## 7. Key screens (brief)

| Screen | Purpose / notes |
|--|--|
| **Claims entrypoint** | Home-screen tile → Claims overview. |
| **Claims overview** | Two tabs: **Open** (rejected + draft claims + unassigned expenses) and **Sent** (pending + approved). Last-selected tab persisted. Rejected shown only when `rejectedClaimsCount > 0`. Empty states: full or partial (per section). FAB Quick Actions. |
| **Create claim screen** | Full-screen provider Form; Save creates Draft; Back exits without creating. |
| **Draft claims list** | Draft-state claims; tap → detail. |
| **Rejected claims list** | Rejected-state claims (via red banner); tap → detail. |
| **Claim detail** | Header (name; "Add unassigned expenses" when `canLinkExpenses=true`); kebab (Edit if `canEdit`, Delete if `canDelete`); total(s); claim date; description (if not empty); details link (if `canViewDetails`); expense items; state labels; **Submit for approval** only in Draft/Rejected. Rejected adds Rejected label, general rejection message, and rejected-expenses list with `approverComment`. |
| **Claim overview (pending/approved)** | Sent-tab detail; shows Pending/Approved label. |
| **Assigned expense detail** | Standard expense detail + Edit/Unlink/Delete per flags. |
| **Unassigned expense detail** | Standard expense detail + Edit (if `canEdit`), Delete (if `canDelete`), "Add to claim" always. |
| **Unassigned expenses list** | List + multi-select; bottom sheet Add to claim / Delete. |
| **Open claims list (selection mode)** | Entered only during linking; shows only linkable claims; radio single-select; always-visible bottom sheet "Add to this claim" + count; "Cancel" only when a claim is selected. |

## 8. Notable rules, edge cases & validations (QA-relevant)
- **Submit disabled** when: not Draft/Rejected, OR no expenses, OR missing required info, OR any linked expense invalid.
- **Empty claim** → empty state + cannot submit.
- **Only Draft/Rejected/Pending(provider) claims linkable**; Approved never linkable; verify `supportsExpenseLinking` filtering across all entry points.
- **Delete claim / delete expense / unlink** all require explicit confirmation; delete claim warns it's irreversible.
- **Kebab hidden entirely** when no actions available; single-action sheet when only one flag true.
- **Actions gated by flags:** `canEdit`, `canDelete`, `canUnlinkExpenses`, `canLinkExpenses`, `canViewDetails`.
- **Link to claim always available** even when other actions are restricted.
- **Unlinked expense returns to Unassigned**; deleted expense removed from all views.
- **Save button on Create Form** appears only when a change is recognised.
- **Amounts:** `totalAmounts` is a list; only top two shown when >2; multi-currency possible.
- **Description** hidden when empty/null; **Details link** hidden when `canViewDetails=false`.
- **Rejected claim** shows `approverComment` per rejected expense.
- **Tab state persistence** on Claims overview.
- **Overview counters** drive visibility: rejected hidden when count 0; full vs partial empty states.
- **Multi-select bottom sheet** button greyed with 0 selected.
- **Error/retry paths:** create Form (stay & retry), submit (remains editable), link (retry on network/timeout), delete/unlink/edit (no change on backend error).

